smartinit V3.2.21 Q1FY14      
Jeff McQueen
November 21, 2013

This upgrade is primarily needed for the implementation of RTMA v2.2.0 scheduled for 
Q1FY14.
An error in reading parent model visibility for the ak_rtmages alaska RUNTYP was found and corrected in sorc/nam_smartinit/GETGRIB.f90 for forecast hours 1,2,4,5,7,8,10,11. Downscaled visibility will now eb correctly output for the ak_rtmages in-between hour files.

For this version, NCO ECF submission will be exactly the same as previous upgrade.
JNAM_SMINIT will continue to be triggered every 3 hrs from 00-84 forecast hours
by existence of NAM BGRD or BSMART post files as done for previous upgrades.

The following RUNTYP submissions will continue as before(RUNTYP set in ecf scripts?).
# NCO SUBMISSION  ffhrs     RUNTYP
#                 00-12     ak_rtmages
#                 00-84     conus,ak,hi,pr
#                 00-60     aknest3,conusnest2p5

BUILD INSTRUCTIONS:
checkout https://svnemc.ncep.noaa.gov/projects/smartinit/tags/nam_smartinit.v3.2.21

1.  Check out and copy to /nwprod/smartinit.v3.2.21
    cd /nwprod/smartinit.v3.2.21

2.  Build sorc codes nam_smartinit.fd, nam_smartprecip.fd
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/nam_smartinit.fd
        make
        cp nam_smartinit ../../smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
        cd ...smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/nam_smartprecip.fd
        make
        cp nam_smartprecip ...smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
  
3.  Use ...docs/smartinit.ver file if desired to set 
      model_ver=v3.2.21  parameter

4.  See ...docs/bjobcards-dev for recommended limits to use in JNAM_SMINIT jobs.
    eg: 
#BSUB -W 03:00
#BSUB -n 1
#BSUB -R rusage[mem=5500]
#BSUB -q dev
#BSUB -P RTMA

5.  Set RUNTYP,cyc, ffhr from ecflow scripts or in specific JNAM_SMINIT jobs.

